Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Recommends: unattended-upgrades
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/d13co/go-algorand
Description: Algorand node with time travel (state at past rounds)
 A fork of the Algorand node software that keeps the value of every ledger
 object at every round, so that lookups, the REST API and simulation work at
 any past round.
 .
 It installs alongside the algorand package: its commands have a tt prefix
 (ttalgod, ttgoal, ttkmd, ...) and its node lives in /var/lib/ttalgorand. The
 node, ttalgorand.service, is not started on install: it syncs from genesis, so
 set TimeTravelDBDir or import an archive with ttimport first.
